Subject: [PATCH] Use pre-funded inventory (0.05 BTC per venue) in research and
 paper_watch configs

- risk.inventory: pre_funded with initial_base_by_venue 0.05 BTC on BINANCE
  and BYBIT; quote from the existing 10,000 USDT initial_capital_by_venue.
  Run summaries are labelled PRE_FUNDED_INVENTORY_NO_REBALANCING.
- On recorded cycles 0006-0010 nothing is refused and equity PnL is
  unchanged (base drifts <= 0.007 BTC per 30-minute cycle).
- Multi-strategy plumbing tests pin unconstrained inventory (the synthetic
  stream is a one-directional arb that drains BYBIT in five packages); a new
  test covers that shared-inventory drain explicitly.
- 250 tests pass; run_all_local passes (paper release id changes with the
  config, as expected).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
